            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-slate-800 flex items-center gap-3">
                <span class="text-indigo-500 bg-indigo-50 px-3 py-1 rounded-lg">✦</span>
                <span class="en-text">History & Discovery</span>
                <span class="th-text">ประวัติการค้นพบ</span>
