                            <text x="180" y="113" class="th-text" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Sarabun, sans-serif" font-size="14" fill="#475569" font-weight="bold">พื้นที่ปีก (A)</text>

                            <text x="210" y="70" class="en-text" text-anchor="end" font-family="Sarabun, sans-serif" font-size="16" fill="#7c3aed" font-weight="bold">Lift (F)</text>
                            <text x="210" y="70" class="th-text" text-anchor="end" font-family="Sarabun, sans-serif" font-size="16" fill="#7c3aed" font-weight="bold">แรงยก (F)</text>
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="text-[15px] text-slate-700 mb-6 leading-loose bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
                        <span class="en-text">Air flows past an airplane wing. The speed of air over the top surface is </span>
                        <span class="th-text">อากาศไหลผ่านปีกเครื่องบิน ความเร็วของอากาศที่ผิวบนปีกคือ </span>
                        <input type="number" id="inEx3V1" value="250" step="5" class="inline-input" oninput="runAllCalculations()">
                        
                        <span class="en-text"> m/s, and under the bottom surface is </span>
                        <span class="th-text"> m/s และความเร็วที่ผิวล่างคือ </span>
                        <input type="number" id="inEx3V2" value="220" step="5" class="inline-input" oninput="runAllCalculations()">
                        
                        <span class="en-text"> m/s. Given the wing area is </span>
                        <span class="th-text"> m/s กำหนดให้พื้นที่ปีกคือ </span>
                        <input type="number" id="inEx3A" value="30" step="1" class="inline-input" oninput="runAllCalculations()">
                        
                        <span class="en-text"> m², find the lift force generated.</span>
                        <span class="th-text"> m² จงหาแรงยก (Lift Force) ที่เกิดขึ้น</span>
                        <br>
                        <span class="text-slate-500 text-sm mt-3 block bg-slate-50 p-3 rounded-lg w-fit border border-slate-100 mx-auto md:mx-0">
                            (<span id="math-ex3-air" class="notranslate" translate="no"></span>)
                        </span>
                    </div>

                    <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 text-slate-800 shadow-inner flex flex-col items-center">
                        <div class="text-purple-700 font-bold mb-3 border-b border-purple-100 pb-2 w-full text-center">
                            <span class="en-text">Step 1: Pressure Difference</span>
                            <span class="th-text">ขั้นที่ 1: หาความต่างศักย์ของความดัน</span> 
                            <span id="math-e3-dp" class="notranslate" translate="no"></span>
                        </div>
                        <div id="solEx3Eq1" class="math-wrapper notranslate w-full" translate="no"></div>
                        
                        <div class="text-purple-700 font-bold mb-3 mt-8 border-b border-purple-100 pb-2 w-full text-center">
                            <span class="en-text">Step 2: Lift Force</span>
                            <span class="th-text">ขั้นที่ 2: หาแรงยกปีก</span> 
                            <span id="math-e3-f" class="notranslate" translate="no"></span>
                        </div>
                        <div id="solEx3Eq2" class="math-wrapper notranslate w-full" translate="no"></div>
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>

    </main>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer class="bg-slate-800 text-slate-400 text-sm py-8 text-center mt-8">
        <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4">
